- Dual-probe model degradation ("降智") fingerprint detection, passive sentinel
  verification, rate-limit-aware recovery scheduling, SSE response.model preflight
  failover, non-streaming/compact degraded-response replay, and probe-period
  candidate deprioritization.
- Windows automatic account switching reliability, strict process-stop boundaries,
  desktop controller resilience, and guarded Codex session continuation.
- Unified macOS DMG and Windows NSIS desktop build workflows.

